# Endpoint operations

- Git: Conventional Commits (`feat` / `fix` / `refactor` / `docs` / `test` / `chore`)
- Tools: `pm2`, `vite`, `npm`, `tsx`, `npx`, `nvm`, `pwsh`, `bash`
- Hosts and private paths: `private/connectivity.md` (do not quote)

## How to test `endpoint` (only when this task needs it)

- Code: `apps/CWSP-shell/src/endpoint/server` (compat) or `apps/CWSP-reborn/runtime/endpoint`
- Logs: `pm2 logs` — do not truncate unless asked
- Restart: `pm2 restart ecosystem.config.cjs --only cws --env production --update-env`
- Local iterate: `pm2 stop cws` then `npm run dev` in the endpoint package
- KVM cursor hostage on desk `.110`: `node scripts/kvm-cursor-unfreeze.mjs`
- AirPad UI: `apps/CWSP-shell/src/frontend/views/airpad/`

Topology and packet contract: `.cursor/rules/network.mdc`.
